<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Millennium.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Millennium.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennium &amp; Copthorne Hotels Plc was rated &quot;neutral&quot; as Lehman Brothers started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>In a research note, Lehman analyst Fraser Ramzan said the company's management had a proven track record in property investment and delivering better earnings from acquired properties, though its near-term earnings growth prospects were weak.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
